\ The freeze-time walk descends into a mutable value-keyed map, so a quotation stored as one of its
\ values is seen. Under the interpreter-free lock a metadata-only image carries empty word bodies,
\ so the module word that quotation calls must be compiled. The build promotes it and the dispatch
\ runs.
\
\ The companion `aot_mutable_value_map_module.1z` is the same module built with
\ `--emit-runtime-image`.

use "./support/mutable_value_map_state.1z" ;

1 7 run-handler .
